{% comment %}
  Generic, metafield-driven configurator options container. Rendered inside
  the product add-to-cart form (buy-buttons), same slot geschirr-
  configurator-options.liquid uses for the Geschirr product.

  Unlike that file, no fieldsets/swatches are hand-authored here -
  assets/configurator.js builds them entirely from the product's
  custom.canvas_layers metafield (the same data configurator-preview.liquid
  reads), including the hidden line-item property inputs. This element is
  just the container it appends into.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="configurator__options" data-form-id="{{ product_form_id }}"></div>
